---
title: "Fig 2.4c — Rotation du Refresh Token"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor       User        as Utilisateur
    participant FE          as Next.js Frontend
    participant NA          as NextAuth.js
    participant BE          as NestJS API
    participant DB          as PostgreSQL
    participant GH          as GitHub OAuth
    participant JW          as JWT Service

    FE->>NA: Requête API avec accessToken expiré
    activate NA
    NA->>NA: jwt() callback — détecte expiration accessToken

    NA->>BE: POST /auth/refresh { refreshToken }
    activate BE

    BE->>JW: verifyRefreshToken(refreshToken)
    activate JW
    JW-->>BE: payload { userId } | erreur
    deactivate JW

    alt refreshToken invalide ou expiré
        BE-->>NA: 401 Unauthorized
        NA-->>FE: Session invalidée
        FE-->>User: Redirige vers /login
    else refreshToken valide
        BE->>DB: SELECT * FROM User WHERE id = userId
        activate DB
        DB-->>BE: User record
        deactivate DB

        BE->>JW: signAccessToken(userId, email, roles)
        BE->>JW: signRefreshToken(userId)
        activate JW
        JW-->>BE: { newAccessToken, newRefreshToken }
        deactivate JW

        BE-->>NA: 200 OK { accessToken, refreshToken }
        deactivate BE

        NA->>NA: jwt() callback — met à jour le token chiffré
        NA-->>FE: Session renouvelée
        deactivate NA
        FE-->>User: Requête relancée avec le nouveau token
    end
